{"hw":"ἤτοι","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἤτοι</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἤτοι</span>: <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">I</span> = ἦτοι, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.446</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">O.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.3</span> </span>, etc. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> = ἤ τοι, v. ἤ (A).</div></div>"}